*Repo root. In GitHub's filename box type exactly: .gitignore*

```text
# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

# --- Virtual environments ---
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# --- Test / tooling caches ---
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- AI FPGA Engineer working output ---
# Generated project workspaces (keep the curated sample under
# ai_fpga_engineer/projects/alu8, ignore everything else the CLI writes).
projects/
!ai_fpga_engineer/projects/
!ai_fpga_engineer/projects/alu8/
!ai_fpga_engineer/projects/alu8/**
# GHDL simulation byproducts
*.cf
*.ghw
work-obj*.cf

# --- Editors / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
```

